              "text": "Seconds",
              "kind": "type"
            }
          ],
          "params": [],
          "returnType": null,
          "description": "Floor under the per-frame slice, granted even on a frame that has already missed its target, so the coroutine stepped first always sees a positive FrameBudget.timeRemaining. Default is a 64th of the display cadence - 0.26 ms at 60 Hz, 0.11 ms at 144 Hz. Set it to zero to decline the grant."
        },
